Scoped Sample Dump eXchange (SDX) demuxer

The 'SDX:' probe, the 0x1a header scan, the version, name-length, bit-depth
and sample-rate fields, the depth-to-codec table and the block alignment in
src/sdx.ts follow libavformat/sdxdec.c (sdx_probe, sdx_read_header). Packets
follow libavformat/pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet, ff_pcm_default_packet_size)
through the shared raw PCM reader.
